@div barsud A

A.1. in-nin₉ zag dib {d}a-nun-na-ke₄-ne me kilib₃-ba ur₄-ur₄#
#lem: innin[lady]; zag[side]; dib[pass]; Anunak[1]DN; me[Being]; kilib[total]; ur[gather]
#etcsl: line-id=A.1

A.2. igi-zu nir-ŋal₂ an ki-bi-da kur-kur-ra igi ŋal₂
#lem: igi[eye]; nirŋal[authoritative]; an[sky]; ki[place]; kur[mountain(s)]; igi[eye]; ŋal[⟦be⟧ to be (there]
#etcsl: line-id=A.2

A.3. {d}inana piriŋ an-na mul-mul-lu me-zu galam-galam-ma
#lem: Inanak[1]DN; piriŋ[lion]; an[sky]; mul[shine]; me[Being]; galam[skilful]
#etcsl: line-id=A.3

A.4. ŋarza-zu niŋ₂ nu-kur₂-ru-dam ŋiš-hur-zu dugud-da
#lem: ŋarza[rites]; niŋ[thing]; kur[different]; ŋešhur[plan]; dugud[heavy]
#etcsl: line-id=A.4

@div trailer 

A.5. bar-sud-am₃
#lem: barsud[musical notation]
#etcsl: line-id=A.5

@end trailer

@end barsud

@div sa-gida B

B.6. dim₂-ma-zu abzu su₃-ra₂-am₃ igi bar-re nu-um-zu
#lem: dimma[thought]; abzu[(cosmic) underground water]; sud[distant]; igi[eye]; bar[place outside]; zu[know]
#etcsl: line-id=B.6

B.7. a-ra₂ ak-a-zu niŋ₂ gal-gal-am₃ diŋir nu-me-da-sa₂
