#etcsl: line-id=B.7

B.8. me-zu ud silim-ma-bi ba-e-de₆ niŋ₂-nam la-ba-e-da-šub
#lem: me[Being]; ud[sun]; silim[healthy]; de[carry]; niŋnam[anything]; šub[fall]
#etcsl: line-id=B.8

B.9. nam-lugal zu₂ keše₂-me niŋ₂-nam-ma šu-zu la-ba-ra-e₃
