E.36. {d}inana ur₂ kug niŋ₂ dug₃-za {d}ur-{d}nin-urta-ke₄ nam-til₃-la ud ha-ba-ni-ib-su₃-ud-de₃
#lem: Inanak[1]DN; ur[loin]; kug[purify]; niŋ[thing]; dug[good]; Urninurta[1]RN; namtil[life]; ud[sun]; sud[distant]
#etcsl: line-id=E.36

